# Alembic cheat sheet

To generate a new revision with a message (the message is optional):\
`alembic revision --autogenerate -m "Added device and device_binding table" --rev-id=some_revision_id`

Relative upgrade and downgrade:\
`alembic upgrade +1`\
`alembic upgrade +2`\
`alembic upgrade 060c55fadf18+3`\
`alembic downgrade -1`\
`alembic downgrade -2`\
`alembic downgrade 060c55fadf18-3`

Absolute upgrade and downgrade:\
`alembic upgrade 060c55fadf18`\
`alembic upgrade head`\
`alembic downgrade 060c55fadf18`\
`alembic downgrade base`

Revision order:\
`alembic history`

Info about current alembic version in the database:\
`alembic current`

To stamp a version (force a change in the database revision without changing the database):\
`alembic stamp head`\
`alembic stamp 060c55fadf18`